msgid "Open your profile URL like <code>%s</code>, and the numeric part is your account ID."
msgstr "点击你的个人主页，URL类似为<code>%s</code>，数字部分就是你的ID。"

msgid "Create your <code>TMDB API Key</code> at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api"
